## Video and audio

`<video src=… />` and `<audio src=… />` take `autoplay`, `loop`, `muted` and `controls=false`. Audio gives a player bar.
A video can also be a slide's background: `background: clip.mp4` in the `<slide>` block.

<video src=clip.webm autoplay loop muted />

<code lang=text>
  <video src=clip.webm autoplay loop muted />
  <audio src=talk.mp3 autoplay />
</code>

<notes>
  autoplay implies muted (browsers block unmuted autoplay). controls=false hides the controls.
</notes>
